<section class="page-hero compact"><div class="wrap"><h1>Terms of use</h1><p class="muted">Last updated: {{TODAY}}</p></div></section>
<section class="wrap prose">
<p>By using Geo.Vision (the "Site") you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.</p>
<h2>1. Use of the Site</h2><p>You may use the Site for personal, educational and internal business purposes. You agree not to misuse it — for example by attempting to disrupt it, scraping it at a rate that degrades service, submitting spam or false information through forms, or using it for unlawful purposes.</p>
<h2>2. Information only — no warranties</h2><p>Content, data, maps and tool results are provided "as is" for general information and education. Live and daily data comes from third parties and may be delayed, incomplete or inaccurate. Do not rely on the Site for navigation, emergency response, safety-critical decisions, surveying, legal boundaries or professional advice. See our <a href="disclaimer.html">disclaimer</a>.</p>
<h2>3. Geo.Vision Projects (matching service)</h2><p>We introduce clients to independent providers. We are not a party to any agreement between you and a provider, do not guarantee their work, pricing, licensing or availability, and are not liable for their acts or omissions. Clients should verify credentials, insurance and contract terms. Providers agree to respond professionally and lawfully and to handle client data responsibly.</p>
<h2>4. Contests</h2><p>Contests are governed by the <a href="contests.html#rules">official rules</a> published on the contest page, which form part of these terms.</p>
<h2>5. Donations</h2><p>Donations are voluntary, processed by PayPal and non-refundable except where required by law or in cases of clear error. Geo.Vision is not a registered charity; donations are not tax-deductible.</p>
<h2>6. Intellectual property</h2><p>The Site's original text, design, code and graphics are owned by Geo.Vision. Third-party data, imagery, videos and marks belong to their owners and are used under their licences or terms — see our <a href="trademark.html">trademark &amp; copyright disclosure</a>. You may share links and short excerpts with attribution.</p>
<h2>7. User submissions</h2><p>You are responsible for content you submit and confirm you have the right to submit it. You grant us a licence to use submissions as needed to provide the requested service (and, for contest entries, as stated in the contest rules).</p>
<h2>8. Third-party links and ads</h2><p>The Site contains links, embedded content and advertisements from third parties. We are not responsible for their content, products or practices.</p>
<h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2><p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Geo.Vision is not liable for indirect, incidental or consequential damages arising from use of the Site. Our total liability for any claim is limited to USD 100.</p>
<h2>10. Changes and governing law</h2><p>We may update these terms; continued use means you accept the updated version. These terms are governed by the laws applicable at the owner's place of business, without regard to conflict-of-law rules. Questions? <a href="contact.html">Contact us</a>.</p>
